WEBVTT

00:14:28.477 --> 00:14:31.502
ali nedavno sam proučavao i prirodu.

00:14:31.502 --> 00:14:35.132
Znate, pčele se javljaju u rojevima,

00:14:35.132 --> 00:14:37.843
a ribe u jatima.

00:14:37.843 --> 00:14:40.656
Čvorci, u području oko Edinburgha,

00:14:40.656 --> 00:14:42.139
u engleskim močvarama,

00:14:42.139 --> 00:14:44.233
javljaju se u nečemu zvanom "žamorenje",

00:14:44.233 --> 00:14:47.005
naziv se odnosi na žamor krila ptica.

00:14:47.005 --> 00:14:48.918
Tijekom dana čvorci se rašire

00:14:48.918 --> 00:14:50.783
u radijusu od otprilike 32 kilometra

00:14:50.783 --> 00:14:52.824
dok rade što već rade.

00:14:52.824 --> 00:14:54.588
Navečer se sastanu

00:14:54.588 --> 00:14:56.710
i stvaraju jednu od najspektakularnijih stvari

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.305
u cijeloj prirodi,

00:14:58.305 --> 00:15:00.359
i to se zove „žamorenje“.